# Adaptation: authoring instructions

Use for a project-wide practical rule on maintaining owner instructions. Copy only
payload, fill fields, recompute output links. Default output:
`docs/instructions/instruction-authoring.md`. [Metadata](../../references/metadata.md)
is shared; [profiled-instruction](../documents/profiled-instruction.md.tmpl) is the
new-owner form. Keep all six responsibilities below; remove only inapplicable client
adapter details, not safety or verification. No automatic loader/permission engine.

